      "text": "Paid overtime is to be authorized for City employees by an Agency or Administration only when such paid overtime is approved by a certificate of the Mayor. Such overtime for City employees shall be paid in accordance with the general rules and regulations promulgated in accordance with the resolution of March 22, 1962 (Cal. No. 379) adopted by the Board of Estimate as amended by Personnel Order No. 54/68 dated June 21, 1968, and amendments to Personnel Order No. 54/68 dated November 19, 1970 and December 2, 1970.",
